 tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q2","e":"simo","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Most of them really plan ahead and make sure they also can prepare the NAND price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q2","e":"simo","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nicolas Emilio Doyle","x":"Maybe also asking a bit of a different way, I mean, you talked about the module maker inventory and how they're pulling in orders in almost fear of price hikes later in the year, I mean, how do their inventories compare to historical?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"The market for eMMC include automotive, commercial, industrial, IoT, smart devices, set-top box and streaming devices, robotics and many more, including the rapid growing market for smart glasses championed by Meta, Apple, Google, Amazon, Xiaomi and others.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Growing AI demand is also forcing a more disciplined CapEx spending approach and is driving difficult resource allocation decisions by the memory and storage makers to prioritize engineering resources across multiple technologies, products and markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Our MonTitan solution ideally suited to address the increasing requirements of AI workload for both compute SSD using TLC and high-capacity warm storage SSD using QLC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jason Tsai","x":"Despite the uncertainty this year given rapid geopolitical changes and tariff impacts, our team has remained focused on execution and building an incredibly strong pipeline for long-term growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"While the overall market has experienced challenges in 2025, given the broader geopolitical and tariff issues, we continue to grow our product portfolio and market share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hsin Yeh","x":"So as we head into 2026, we see both our foundry partner and OSAT partners all initiating price hike to reflect the elevated material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q3","e":"simo","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hsin Yeh","x":"And do you think we can further pass through all these elevated costs to our customers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/silicon-motion-simo-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"We are shipping eMMC into automotive, industrial, commercial, IoT, smart device, streaming device and many other markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Our UFS controller majority is smartphone. eMMC controller majority is in IoT devices, smart device, streaming device and set-top box and nonautomotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Growing AI demand in focusing a more disciplined CapEx approach by memory and storage market to prioritize resources across multiple technology products and market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"The opportunity of Silicon Motion in data centers and AI infrastructure expanding daily.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"AI CSPs has attempt to lock up all the DRAM and NAND supply through 2026, which has made it increasingly difficult for other market player to get product and is driving significant intra-quarter price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2025 Q4","e":"simo","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"While this has become more difficult given the supply constraint and recent price increases, we remain confident that our relationship with the NAND flash maker developed over the past 20 years will help us succeed with these significant new opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/silicon-motion-simo-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2026 Q1","e":"simo","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Tsai","x":"Operating expenses increased sequentially to $99.2 million, given increased investments in our emerging MonTitan AI and enterprise SSD controller and boot drive storage solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/silicon-motion-simo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2026 Q1","e":"simo","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Tsai","x":"We are also beginning to reap the benefits of our multiyear investments in eSSDs for enterprise and AI with MonTitan and our growing boot drive storage business beginning to ramp in volume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/silicon-motion-simo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2026 Q1","e":"simo","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chia-Chang Kou","x":"Despite ongoing supply constraints and price increases associated with the NAND and DRAM, we continue to expect that we will deliver sequential growth throughout 2026 as we reap the benefit from the investments we have made over the past few years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/silicon-motion-simo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2026 Q1","e":"simo","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Gokul Hariharan","x":"Because this is something that we hear from some of the other vendors that even though end demand has been not that great, there's been some pull forward demand, customers trying to stock up inventory ahead of cost hikes and price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/silicon-motion-simo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SIMO 2026 Q2","e":"simo","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Tsai","x":"Investments in new advanced geometry products for both our established m